 policy explains what personal data we collect, why we collect it, and the rights you can exercise at any time."}]]}],null]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"w-full py-space-3xl bg-surface","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin lg:px-margin-desktop grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-[300px_1fr] gap-space-2xl","children":[["$","aside",null,{"className":"hidden xl:block","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"sticky top-28 space-y-space-lg","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-forest-deep tracking-wider","children":"On this page"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Privacy Policy sections","children":["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-1.5 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","li","Who We Are",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#who-we-are","children":"Who We Are"}]}],["$","li","Information We Collect",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#information-we-collect","children":"Information We Collect"}]}],["$","li","How We Use Your Information",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#how-we-use-your-information","children":"How We Use Your Information"}]}],["$","li","Legal Bases for Processing",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#legal-bases-for-processing","children":"Legal Bases for Processing"}]}],["$","li","Cookies and Similar Technologies",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#cookies-and-similar-technologies","children":"Cookies and Similar Technologies"}]}],["$","li","International Transfers",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#international-transfers","children":"International Transfers"}]}],["$","li","Data Retention",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#data-retention","children":"Data Retention"}]}],["$","li","Your Rights",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#your-rights","children":"Your Rights"}]}],["$","li","Security",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#security","children":"Security"}]}],["$","li","Contact Us",{"children":["$","a",null,{"className":"block hover:text-forest-deep transition-colors leading-snug","href":"#contact-us","children":"Contact Us"}]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-space-xs text-label-sm font-label-sm text-slate-text-muted border-t border-slate-border pt-space-md","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-forest-mid","children":"update"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Last updated ","1 September 2025"]}]]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl space-y-space-2xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"This Privacy Policy explains how Aakash AP Ltd collects, uses, and protects personal information when you visit our website, engage our services, or apply for a role with us. We are committed to handling personal data lawfully, transparently, and with the same governance standards we apply to our clients. If you have any questions, please contact us at advisory@aakashap.com."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-space-xs text-label-sm font-label-sm text-slate-text-muted xl:hidden","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-forest-mid","children":"update"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Last updated ","1 September 2025"]}]]}],[["$","section","Who We Are",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"who-we-are","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Who We Are"}],[["$","p","Aakash AP Ltd is a company registered in England and Wales that provides offshore recruitment process outsourcing and business process outsourcing services to clients in the United Kingdom, the United States, and internationally. Our delivery centres are located in Manila, Cape Town, Krakow, and Bangalore.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Aakash AP Ltd is a company registered in England and Wales that provides offshore recruitment process outsourcing and business process outsourcing services to clients in the United Kingdom, the United States, and internationally. Our delivery centres are located in Manila, Cape Town, Krakow, and Bangalore."}],["$","p","For the purposes of UK data protection law, Aakash AP Ltd is the data controller for personal information processed through this website and in the course of our own business operations. Where we process candidate or client data on behalf of a client organisation, we act as a data processor and the client remains the controller.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"For the purposes of UK data protection law, Aakash AP Ltd is the data controller for personal information processed through this website and in the course of our own business operations. Where we process candidate or client data on behalf of a client organisation, we act as a data processor and the client remains the controller."}]],null]}],["$","section","Information We Collect",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"information-we-collect","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Information We Collect"}],[["$","p","We collect personal information in the following ways:",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"We collect personal information in the following ways:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-space-xs","children":[["$","li","Information you provide directly, such as your name, email address, telephone number, company details, and any message you send through our contact forms or by email.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Information you provide directly, such as your name, email address, telephone number, company details, and any message you send through our contact forms or by email."}]]}],["$","li","Recruitment information, including CVs, employment history, qualifications, and references, when you apply for a role with us or through a client engagement.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Recruitment information, including CVs, employment history, qualifications, and references, when you apply for a role with us or through a client engagement."}]]}],["$","li","Client engagement data, such as contact details of client personnel and candidate records processed on behalf of clients under their documented instructions.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Client engagement data, such as contact details of client personnel and candidate records processed on behalf of clients under their documented instructions."}]]}],["$","li","Technical information, including IP address, browser type, device information, and pages visited, collected through cookies and similar technologies.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Technical information, including IP address, browser type, device information, and pages visited, collected through cookies and similar technologies."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","How We Use Your Information",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"how-we-use-your-information","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"How We Use Your Information"}],[["$","p","We use personal information to respond to enquiries, provide and administer our services, manage our contractual relationships, and operate our website securely. Where you have applied for a role, we use your information to assess your application, arrange interviews, and carry out pre-employment vetting where applicable.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"We use personal information to respond to enquiries, provide and administer our services, manage our contractual relationships, and operate our website securely. Where you have applied for a role, we use your information to assess your application, arrange interviews, and carry out pre-employment vetting where applicable."}],["$","p","We may also use contact details to send service updates, industry insights, or marketing communications where permitted by law. You can opt out of marketing communications at any time using the unsubscribe link in any message or by contacting us directly. We do not sell personal information to third parties.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"We may also use contact details to send service updates, industry insights, or marketing communications where permitted by law. You can opt out of marketing communications at any time using the unsubscribe link in any message or by contacting us directly. We do not sell personal information to third parties."}]],null]}],["$","section","Legal Bases for Processing",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"legal-bases-for-processing","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Legal Bases for Processing"}],[["$","p","Under the UK GDPR and the EU GDPR, we rely on the following legal bases: performance of a contract, where processing is necessary to provide services you or your organisation have engaged us for; legitimate interests, such as running and improving our business and responding to business enquiries; legal obligation, where we must retain or disclose information to comply with the law; and consent, where you have opted in to marketing or other optional processing.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Under the UK GDPR and the EU GDPR, we rely on the following legal bases: performance of a contract, where processing is necessary to provide services you or your organisation have engaged us for; legitimate interests, such as running and improving our business and responding to business enquiries; legal obligation, where we must retain or disclose information to comply with the law; and consent, where you have opted in to marketing or other optional processing."}],["$","p","Where we rely on legitimate interests, we have carried out balancing assessments to confirm that our interests do not override your rights and freedoms. You may object to processing based on legitimate interests at any time.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Where we rely on legitimate interests, we have carried out balancing assessments to confirm that our interests do not override your rights and freedoms. You may object to processing based on legitimate interests at any time."}]],null]}],["$","section","Cookies and Similar Technologies",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"cookies-and-similar-technologies","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Cookies and Similar Technologies"}],[["$","p","Our website uses cookies and similar technologies to enable core functionality, remember your preferences, and understand how visitors use our pages. Essential cookies are required for the website to function, while analytics cookies help us improve content and performance.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Our website uses cookies and similar technologies to enable core functionality, remember your preferences, and understand how visitors use our pages. Essential cookies are required for the website to function, while analytics cookies help us improve content and performance."}],["$","p","You can manage or withdraw consent for non-essential cookies at any time through our cookie preferences tool or your browser settings. Full details are set out in our Cookie Policy & Preferences.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"You can manage or withdraw consent for non-essential cookies at any time through our cookie preferences tool or your browser settings. Full details are set out in our Cookie Policy & Preferences."}]],null]}],["$","section","International Transfers",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"international-transfers","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"International Transfers"}],[["$","p","As an offshore services provider, we may transfer personal information to our delivery centres in the Philippines, South Africa, Poland, and India, and to vetted sub-processors in other jurisdictions. Where personal data is transferred outside the United Kingdom or the European Economic Area, we put appropriate safeguards in place.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"As an offshore services provider, we may transfer personal information to our delivery centres in the Philippines, South Africa, Poland, and India, and to vetted sub-processors in other jurisdictions. Where personal data is transferred outside the United Kingdom or the European Economic Area, we put appropriate safeguards in place."}],["$","p","These safeguards include the UK International Data Transfer Agreement, the UK Addendum to the EU Standard Contractual Clauses, and supplementary technical and organisational measures such as encrypted channels, access controls, and data minimisation. Copies of the relevant safeguards are available on request.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"These safeguards include the UK International Data Transfer Agreement, the UK Addendum to the EU Standard Contractual Clauses, and supplementary technical and organisational measures such as encrypted channels, access controls, and data minimisation. Copies of the relevant safeguards are available on request."}]],null]}],["$","section","Data Retention",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"data-retention","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Data Retention"}],[["$","p","We retain personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes for which it was collected, including to satisfy legal, accounting, or reporting requirements. Recruitment records are typically retained for up to twenty-four months after the conclusion of an application process, unless you ask us to keep them longer or applicable law requires otherwise.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"We retain personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes for which it was collected, including to satisfy legal, accounting, or reporting requirements. Recruitment records are typically retained for up to twenty-four months after the conclusion of an application process, unless you ask us to keep them longer or applicable law requires otherwise."}],["$","p","Client engagement records are retained for the duration of the contract and for a minimum of six years afterwards where required for tax, audit, or contractual purposes. When retention periods expire, data is securely deleted or anonymised in line with our information security standards.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Client engagement records are retained for the duration of the contract and for a minimum of six years afterwards where required for tax, audit, or contractual purposes. When retention periods expire, data is securely deleted or anonymised in line with our information security standards."}]],null]}],["$","section","Your Rights",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"your-rights","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Your Rights"}],[["$","p","Subject to applicable law, you have the following rights in relation to your personal information:",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Subject to applicable law, you have the following rights in relation to your personal information:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-space-xs","children":[["$","li","The right to access a copy of the personal information we hold about you.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The right to access a copy of the personal information we hold about you."}]]}],["$","li","The right to request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The right to request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information."}]]}],["$","li","The right to request erasure of information where there is no compelling reason for us to continue processing it.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The right to request erasure of information where there is no compelling reason for us to continue processing it."}]]}],["$","li","The right to restrict or object to certain processing activities, including direct marketing.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The right to restrict or object to certain processing activities, including direct marketing."}]]}],["$","li","The right to data portability, where processing is based on consent or contract and carried out by automated means.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The right to data portability, where processing is based on consent or contract and carried out by automated means."}]]}],["$","li","The right to withdraw consent at any time, without affecting the lawfulness of processing carried out before withdrawal.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The right to withdraw consent at any time, without affecting the lawfulness of processing carried out before withdrawal."}]]}],["$","li","The right to lodge a complaint with the Information Commissioner's Office or your local supervisory authority.",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The right to lodge a complaint with the Information Commissioner's Office or your local supervisory authority."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","Security",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"security","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Security"}],[["$","p","We apply administrative, technical, and physical controls designed to protect personal information against unauthorised access, loss, or alteration. These include ISO 27001-aligned information security management, role-based access control, virtual desktop infrastructure, and regular penetration testing.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"We apply administrative, technical, and physical controls designed to protect personal information against unauthorised access, loss, or alteration. These include ISO 27001-aligned information security management, role-based access control, virtual desktop infrastructure, and regular penetration testing."}],["$","p","Our people operate under confidentiality agreements and receive annual data protection and security training. Further detail is set out in our Security & Service Level Commitments document.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Our people operate under confidentiality agreements and receive annual data protection and security training. Further detail is set out in our Security & Service Level Commitments document."}]],null]}],["$","section","Contact Us",{"className":"space-y-space-md scroll-mt-28","id":"contact-us","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Contact Us"}],[["$","p","If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, wish to exercise your rights, or want to make a data protection request, contact us at advisory@aakashap.com or by post at Aakash AP Ltd, London, United Kingdom. We will respond to verified requests within one month, as required by law.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, wish to exercise your rights, or want to make a data protection request, contact us at advisory@aakashap.com or by post at Aakash AP Ltd, London, United Kingdom. We will respond to verified requests within one month, as required by law."}],["$","p","If you are not satisfied with our response, you have the right to complain to the Information Commissioner's Office in the United Kingdom or to the supervisory authority in y